<title>USA: Infoseek CFO/COO LeBlanc resigns.</title>
<headline>Infoseek CFO/COO LeBlanc resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Infoseek Corp said Monday it has begun an executive search to replace chief operating officer and chief financial officer Leonard LeBlanc, who is resigning effective July 7.</p>
<p>The company said LeBlanc, 56, is leaving to pursue other activities.</p>
<p>Infoseek also said Peter Rip, vice president and general manager of the Infoseek Network, has resigned effective July 7. Rip is leaving to pursue other business interests, the company said.</p>
